{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zepp Nagoyaでライブでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/5647643/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も最高に楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/5647643/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの顔がちゃんと見えて、今もその光景がはっきり浮かびます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり現在ハイテンション＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん、本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/5647643/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブでやった曲は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れ！bicycle"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハウス！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙がまだ悲しみだった頃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼に口笛を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左胸の勇気"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかちなかたつむり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人はなぜ走るのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音が出ないギター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるぐるカーテン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失いたくないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いたかったかもしれない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の詩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ〜お、いっぱいo(^-^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初披露の曲もいくつかあったので、来られなかった方にもぜひいつか見てほしいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/5647643/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝説のおじさん「石神原さん」が乃木坂46のMixを作ってくれたりもして...(^w^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気に入った方はぜひやってくださったらうれしいなっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白いですよ！盛り上がると思うです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにお任せします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Go FLY!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして自分達の曲に加えて、サプライズでAKB48さんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「会いたかった」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「Beginner」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日大阪ではNMB48さんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「オーマイガー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日名古屋ではSKE48さんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「パレオはエメラルド」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を歌わせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/5647643/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達なりに負けないように一生懸命やりました(｀∇´ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだったかなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/5647643/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日今日でライブがこんなに楽しいってこと、初めて知りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして練習では自分達の甘さも知りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと頑張んなきゃいけない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんと一緒に作ったライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この2日間の記憶は絶対忘れないと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもたくさんライブをして、たくさんの方の笑顔を見たいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/5647643/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのために私達は坂を上り続けます(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！そして今日発表になりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パルコ劇場にて、乃木坂46東京公演決定"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/5647643/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達もみなさんと同じタイミングで知ったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ詳しいことは分かってないのですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく頑張るぞっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが来てくださるのを楽しみに待ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/5647643/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/5647643/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんとさゆにゃんがいるよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9:55-11:30　フジテレビ「ノンストップ」に生出演させていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/5647643/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから今週"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"23:30 〜 23:40　フジテレビ「ヤングなでしこ応援委員会」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ見てください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":